 r←Test_Stop_009(debugFlag batchFlag);⎕TRAP;T2;rc;log
⍝ Exercise the `RunThese` method with stop←'?' = Cancel: a result must be returned nevertheless
 ⎕TRAP←(999 'C' '∘∘∘ ⍝ Deliberate error')(0 'N')
 r←T._Failed

 T2←⎕NEW ##.Tester2 TestCasesSimu
 ##.CommTools.Cleanup                                     ⍝ Get rid of any automation left behind by earlier tests
 ##.CommTools.AddAutomation'Select' 'WhereToStop@' 9
 (rc log)←'?'T2.RunThese'Grouping'
 ##.CommTools.Cleanup
 →T.PassesIf 0=rc
 →T.PassesIf 0=≢log

 r←T._OK
